1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,100
The first promise of the internship was small and specific: every claim in the film would have an account behind it.

2
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:17,177
The office had a special room for the material, a manager for the organization, and a career counsellor who had once worked in banking.

3
00:00:17,177 --> 00:00:20,661
“Use the label,” the clerk said.

4
00:00:20,661 --> 00:00:25,625
“If it is not labelled, it is not evidence.”

5
00:00:25,625 --> 00:00:30,064
The field was employment, and the business was real.

6
00:00:30,064 --> 00:00:42,970
A customer with unemployment behind them, a retired teller, a cooperative of small suppliers, and an employee on a zero-hours commission all sat in the same room.

7
00:00:42,970 --> 00:00:47,974
“The competition is not the enemy,” the counsellor said.

8
00:00:47,974 --> 00:00:51,103
“The expense is.”

9
00:00:51,103 --> 00:00:57,447
There was a depression in the industry that year, and a recession in the trade papers.

10
00:00:57,447 --> 00:01:06,519
The ministry had cut the publication budget, and the mail brought a dismissal notice to a colleague who had worked there for nine years.

11
00:01:06,519 --> 00:01:12,537
“This is what an employer looks like when the money stops,” the manager said.

12
00:01:12,537 --> 00:01:14,512
“Write it down.

13
00:01:14,512 --> 00:01:18,361
It is part of the application.”

14
00:01:18,361 --> 00:01:25,569
The partnership with the client had one intangible clause: the team could refuse a submission.

15
00:01:25,569 --> 00:01:29,888
“That is a strange kind of power,” Lin said.

16
00:01:29,888 --> 00:01:33,747
“It is the only kind,” she answered.

17
00:01:33,747 --> 00:01:40,625
“Profession, not employment, is the difference between them and us.”

18
00:01:40,625 --> 00:01:45,863
Their earnings for the summer were enough for a train ticket and a rented room.

19
00:01:45,863 --> 00:01:51,457
“Remove the word career from the next version,” the manager told them.

20
00:01:51,457 --> 00:02:05,668
“Put in the word work.” The accountancy clerk agreed, the tourism intern did not, and the specialization they were offered — a permanent post in the bank — was the first real choice of the arc.

21
00:02:05,668 --> 00:02:12,656
To take it was to accept that a deadline could be a life, and not only a date.

22
00:02:12,656 --> 00:02:25,598
On the last Friday, a black car brought the head of the family to the office: her father, a great supporter of the project, with his mother and her little brother in the back.

23
00:02:25,598 --> 00:02:31,961
They asked one question that nobody could answer — what would happen to them if the post were taken?

24
00:02:31,961 --> 00:02:36,540
“Such a name in a small house,” her father said.

25
00:02:36,540 --> 00:02:50,656
“Big or little, it is by the work that a person is known.” The facility had an operator who could employ three of them, and Maya wrote something down before she answered.
